# Credentials — never commit these
# A Figma personal access token was committed to this public repo once already.
# Deleting a file does not remove it from git history; only revoking the token does.
*token*
*Token*
# ...but the design token stylesheet is not a credential. The rule above silently
# excluded it from every push until 13 August, so the deployed app rendered with
# no palette, no type scale and no spacing. Keep the broad guard; whitelist this one.
!app/css/tokens.css
*.key
*.pem
*.pat
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
credentials.*

# OS
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Design software temp files
*.fig.bak
~$*
*.tmp

# Python (used for asset and Figma analysis)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/

# Node — tooling only (puppeteer-core drives the click-through test)
node_modules/
